:"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-07-05T06:22:29Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/653976857","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7584#issuecomment-653976857","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7584","id":653976857,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY1Mzk3Njg1Nw==","user":{"login":"amoizesmail","id":25241356,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjQxMzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25241356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail","html_url":"https://github.com/amoizesmail","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amoizesmail/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-07-06T01:58:24Z","updated_at":"2020-07-06T01:58:24Z","body":"Hi @kim-vde, \r\n\r\nWe tried the suggested workaround, the using of `ExtractorsFactory` that contains `FragmentedMp4Extractor` only and the issue still persist. \r\n\r\n```\r\nprivate fun getMediaSource(type: Int, dataSourceFactory: DefaultDataSourceFactory, uri: Uri): BaseMediaSource? {\r\n        return when (type) {\r\n            TYPE_DASH -> {\r\n                DashMediaSource.Factory(dataSourceFactory).createMediaSource(uri)\r\n            }\r\n            TYPE_SS -> {\r\n                SsMediaSource.Factory(dataSourceFactory).createMediaSource(uri)\r\n            }\r\n            TYPE_HLS -> {\r\n                HlsMediaSource.Factory(dataSourceFactory).createMediaSource(uri)\r\n            }\r\n            TYPE_OTHER -> {\r\n                ProgressiveMediaSource.Factory(dataSourceFactory, CustomMediaExtractor()).createMediaSource(uri)\r\n            }\r\n            else -> {\r\n                throw IllegalStateException(\"Unsupported type: $type\")\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    class CustomMediaExtractor : ExtractorsFactory {\r\n        override fun createExtractors(): Array<Extractor> {\r\n            return arrayOf(FragmentedMp4Extractor())\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Logcat** \r\n\r\n```\r\ninternalError [2.81, 0.00, window=0, period=0, loadError]\r\n    com.google.android.exoplayer2.source.UnrecognizedInputFormatException: None of the available extractors (FragmentedMp4Extractor) could read the stream.\r\n        at com.google.android.exoplayer2.source.ProgressiveMediaPeriod$ExtractorHolder.selectExtractor(ProgressiveMediaPeriod.java:1059)\r\n        at com.google.android.exoplayer2.source.ProgressiveMediaPeriod$ExtractingLoadable.load(ProgressiveMediaPeriod.java:947)\r\n        at com.google.android.exoplayer2.upstream.Loader$LoadTask.run(Loader.java:381)\r\n        at java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor.runWorker(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:1167)\r\n        at java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor$Worker.run(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:641)\r\n        at java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:764)\r\nplayerFailed [2.82, 0.00, window=0, period=0]\r\n    com.google.android.exoplayer2.ExoPlaybackException: com.google.android.exoplayer2.source.UnrecognizedInputFormatException: None of the available extractors (FragmentedMp4Extractor) could read the stream.\r\n        at com.google.android.exoplayer2.ExoPlayerImplInternal.handleMessage(ExoPlayerImplInternal.java:386)\r\n        at android.os.Handler.dispatc